  "description": "Wrapper for the go CLI — the Go toolchain build driver. Typed verb surface (Build, Test, Vet, Run, Install, Generate, Clean, Fmt, List, Env, Version, Mod, Work, Raw) mirroring Tamp.Cargo conventions. First-class cross-compilation via GOOS/GOARCH/CGO_ENABLED environment emission, ldflags/version-stamping helpers, build tags, -mod modes, and the race/cover build flags. Tamp.Core 1.5.0+ required for the InternalsVisibleTo grant.",
